From cc397f25517db7d09c7379a12787fe6a68ec61f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeplatinum-3ds <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 09:27:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Other Metrowerks-only C that GCC rejects (SDK_PORT_3DS)

- overlay_manager.c: copy into a const struct member with memcpy instead of
  assigning it.
- Casts used as assignment targets ((u8 *)p += n) step the pointer through
  a u8 ** instead (box_app_manager.c, ov97_02232DC8.c, ov5_021ECE40.c).
- mining.c: array sizes from static const variables, which are not constant
  expressions in C, become enum constants.
- nintendo_wfc/main.c: NULL passed for an enum parameter becomes 0.
- underground/comm_manager.c: Shift-JIS debug strings written as \u00XX,
  which Metrowerks read as single bytes, use \xXX.
The original build is unchanged.
---
 src/applications/pc_boxes/box_app_manager.c |  5 +++
 src/main_menu/ov97_02232DC8.c               | 35 +++++++++++++++++++++
 src/nintendo_wfc/main.c                     | 10 ++++++
 src/overlay005/ov5_021ECE40.c               |  5 +++
 src/overlay_manager.c                       |  5 +++
 src/underground/comm_manager.c              | 20 ++++++++++++
 src/underground/mining.c                    | 10 ++++++
 7 files changed, 90 insertions(+)

